v_durability":null,"_score_rev_durability":0.0,"_gate_fcf_durability":null,"_gp_fcf_durability":null,"_score_fcf_durability":null,"_gate_margins":null,"_gp_margins":null,"_score_margins":null,"_gate_fund_growth":null,"_gp_fund_growth":null,"_score_fund_growth":null,"_gate_shrhldr_yield":0.038113268820462155,"_gp_shrhldr_yield":true,"_score_shrhldr_yield":53.5,"_gate_share_shrink":null,"_gp_share_shrink":null,"_score_share_shrink":0.0,"_gate_sbc_dilution":null,"_gp_sbc_dilution":null,"_score_sbc_dilution":0.0,"_gate_insider_own":0.00018999999,"_gp_insider_own":false,"_score_insider_own":0.1,"_gate_insider_buying":null,"_gp_insider_buying":null,"_score_insider_buying":null,"pf":[],"description_full":"Banco Bilbao Vizcaya Argentaria, S.A., together with its subsidiaries, provides various financial services in Spain, Mexico, Turkey, South America, Europe, the United States, and Asia. The company offers traditional retail, wholesale, investment, and transaction banking. It also engages in financial, insurance, asset management, and capital markets businesses, as well as digital banking. The company was formerly known as Banco Bilbao Vizcaya, S.A. and changed its name to Banco Bilbao Vizcaya Argentaria, S.A. in January 2000. Banco Bilbao Vizcaya Argentaria, S.A. was founded in 1857 and is headquartered in Bilbao, Spain.","ceo_bio":"Mr. Onur  Genc | CEO & Executive Director | Age 51 | Compensation: $7.5M (FY2024)","culture_narrative":"Employs approximately 127K people. Each employee generates $122K of free cash flow annually.","financial_summary":["Banco Bilbao Vizcaya Argentaria is a large-cap financial services business with a $128.1B market cap.","Returns on capital run at 194% against a 10% cost of capital \u2014 a 184-point spread that is the clearest signature of an economic moat.","The business throws off $15.5B in free cash flow, which is the owner-earnings figure that actually belongs to shareholders, and cash conversion sits at 1.35\u00d7 so those profits are backed by real cash.","On the balance sheet, the balance sheet carries net cash, which is the gold standard: the business never has to make desperate decisions in a bad year, and thin 0.5\u00d7 interest coverage leaves no room for a bad year.","Shareholder yield of 3.8% reflects a genuine commitment to returning capital rather than empire-building, and insider ownership is negligible, so management has little personal stake in the long-term outcome."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Piotroski score 3/9 \u2014 the fundamentals are deteriorating on multiple fronts","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Altman Z in the distress zone (0.2) \u2014 the kind of balance-sheet risk that can make a loss permanent","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Low reinvestment-driven growth suggests the compounding engine has stalled","sev":"amber","cat":"growth"},{"text":"Financial quality metrics lag Financial Services peers","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"High market volatility with VIX at 36, signaling elevated fear","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Widening credit spreads suggest growing stress in corporate debt markets","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Broad market in a downtrend, trading below its 200-day average","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Multiple macro indicators signal economic contraction","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Credit cycles and regulatory capital \u2014 losses accumulate invisibly in good years and appear all at once, and the time to worry is when underwriting standards are loosest.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Interest rate regime shifts \u2014 a rapid move in rates can invert the yield curve, crush bond portfolios, and trigger deposit flight simultaneously.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Trading at a 66% margin of safety to estimated fair value \u2014 a real cushion against errors in the estimate","Market is pricing in lower growth than the company has historically delivered","36 consecutive years of dividend payments \u2014 an operating record that makes the dividend claim credible","Healthy payout ratio leaves room for both dividend growth and reinvestment","ROIC sits in the top quartile of Financial Services peers \u2014 the moat is wider than the neighbourhood","Minimal goodwill on the balance sheet \u2014 low impairment risk"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"If You Invested $100 In BBVA Stock 5 Years Ago, You Would Have This Much Today","source":"benzinga.com","link":"https://www.benzinga.com/news/26/11/63415650/if-you-invested-100-bbva-stock-5-years-ago-you-would-have-much-today","date":"2026-11-18","timestamp":1795041016.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.0,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Analyzing Banco Bilbao Vizcaya Argentaria (NYSE:BBVA) and LCNB (NASDAQ:LCNB)","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/16/analyzing-banco-bilbao-vizcaya-argentaria-nysebbva-and-lcnb-nasdaqlcnb.html","date":"2026-11-17","timestamp":1794876660.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.893,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Price-Driven Insight from (BBVA) for Rule-Based Strategy","source":"news.stocktradersdaily.com","link":"https://news.stocktradersdaily.com/news_release/14/Price-Driven_Insight_from_BBVA_for_Rule-Based_Strategy_111526035802_1794776282.html","date":"2026-11-15","timestamp":1794776282.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.0,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"BBVA Registers $2.05 Billion Senior Non-Preferred Notes for NYSE Trading","source":"kalkinemedia.com","link":"https://kalkinemedia.com/us/news/announcements/bbva-registers-205-billion-senior-non-preferred-notes-for-nyse-trading","date":"2026-11-13","timestamp":1794586694.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.0,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"BBVA Announces $2.05 Billion Senior Non-Preferred Notes Issuance Across Three Tranches","source":"kalkinemedia.com","link":"https://kalkinemedia.com/us/news/announcements